<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      .header { background-color: #d4edda; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 1px solid #c3e6cb; }
      .content { background-color: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; }
      .button { background-color: #28a745; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; margin: 10px 0; }
      .school-info { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 15px 0; }
      .success-icon { color: #28a745; font-size: 48px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
      .footer { margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef; color: #6c757d; font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="success-icon">✓</div>
        <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #28a745; text-align: center;">Claim Approved!</h1>
        <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; text-align: center;">You can now manage your school's information.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Dear <%= @user.display_name %>,</p>

        <p><strong>Congratulations!</strong> Your claim for <strong><%= @school.name %></strong> has been approved. You now have access to manage and update your school's information on our platform.</p>

        <div class="school-info">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">School Information</h3>
          <p><strong>Name:</strong> <%= @school.name %></p>
          <% if @school.display_address.present? %>
            <p><strong>Address:</strong> <%= @school.display_address %></p>
          <% end %>
          <p><strong>Claim Approved:</strong> <%= @school_claim.updated_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p") %></p>
        </div>

        <h3>What You Can Do Now:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Update Information:</strong> Edit your school's description, contact details, and address</li>
          <li><strong>Manage Features:</strong> Update information about boarding, bus service, and special programs</li>
          <li><strong>Social Media:</strong> Add links to your school's social media accounts</li>
          <li><strong>Monitor Claims:</strong> View the status of all your school claims</li>
        </ul>

        <% if @school_claim.admin_notes.present? %>
          <p><strong>Admin Notes:</strong></p>
          <blockquote style="border-left: 3px solid #28a745; padding-left: 15px; margin: 15px 0; color: #6c757d;">
            <%= simple_format(@school_claim.admin_notes) %>
          </blockquote>
        <% end %>

        <p>Ready to get started? Access your school management dashboard using the secure link below. This link will automatically sign you in and is valid for 48 hours.</p>

        <a href="<%= magic_link_dashboard_url(@magic_token.token) %>" class="button">Access Dashboard</a>
        
        <p style="margin-top: 15px;"><small>This secure link will automatically sign you in. No password required!</small></p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>If you need any help getting started or have questions about managing your school's information, please don't hesitate to contact our support team.</p>
        <p>Thank you for joining our school community!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>